# Large local source PDFs/exports (do not commit)
# Manufacturer flight manuals/QRHs/checklists are copyrighted third-party
# material. We author our own quiz questions/explanations from them, but the
# source PDFs and full-text extractions must not be published to this public
# repo. Only committed derivative content (quiz JSON, our own prose) belongs
# in git.
RFM AW169/
AS350 B3 E/
AS350 B3 2B1/
public/aw169/QRH EP AW169/
public/aw139/qrh/*.pdf

# Local source PDFs (root)
/AW189/
/AW139/
